Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.44,0:00:21.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（基辅）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找了我们{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.13,0:00:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道发生了什么事{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.35,0:00:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩在酒吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.38,0:00:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝酒{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.45,0:00:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩得很开心{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.17,0:00:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至不知道{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么到的这里{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.60,0:00:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 她假死得太久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on. She's been under too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.48,0:00:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你能帮我了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.39,0:01:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.66,0:01:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我想知道的告诉我{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.73,0:01:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会杀了我的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.57,0:01:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你找我们帮你的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.64,0:01:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.05,0:01:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.41,0:01:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,明斯克的联络人是…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.45,0:01:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们名字 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name, pal. Give us the name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.92,0:01:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,季米治 密地夫{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.75,0:01:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在要做什么？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来喝杯酒{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敬你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Za druziye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.56,0:02:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个人渣弄走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get rid of that scum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.12,0:02:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 醒醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire, come on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.10,0:03:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,问出来了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.15,0:03:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,问出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:48.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《碟中谍》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.73,0:03:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要看部电影吗 罗森先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to watch a movie, Mr. Rosen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.98,0:04:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要看部电影吗 费尔普斯先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to watch a movie, Mr. Phelps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.95,0:04:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 我更喜欢看戏剧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I prefer the theater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这部乌克兰的影片怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you consider the cinema of the Ukraine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.37,0:04:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不你帮我挑一部吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you'll choose one for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.19,0:04:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 费尔普斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Mr. Phelps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.14,0:04:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在看见的这个男人是亚历山大·葛里森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man you're looking at is Alexander Golitsyn…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.02,0:04:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我国驻布拉格大使馆馆员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}an attache at our embassy in Prague.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是一个叛徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is also a traitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.28,0:05:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他偷取了中央情报局 NOC 名单的一半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has stolen one half of a C.I.A. NOC list{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.67,0:05:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一份记录了所有 在东欧工作的极机密特工的资料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a record of all our deep-cover agents working in Eastern Europe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.81,0:05:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,出于安全原因 NOC 名单是分成两份的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For security reasons, the NOC list is divided in two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛里森手里的那部分记录了特工代号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The portion that Golitsyn already has… contains code names…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.61,0:05:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果没有另一半 它是没有任何价值的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this half is useless without its mate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.75,0:05:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一半记录了和特工代号匹配的真实姓名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which matches the code names with their true names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛里森计划 从大使馆偷出另一半名单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is this half which Golitsyn plans to steal from the embassy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.07,0:05:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在明晚酒会上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}during a reception tomorrow night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 你可以选择是否接下这个任务：{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mission, Jim, should you choose to accept it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.31,0:05:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到葛里森偷窃和交易过程的录像证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to obtain photographic proof of the theft shadow Golitsyn to his buyer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,并将他们全部逮捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and apprehend them both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.12,0:05:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经派出了由你手下组成的行动组{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've already dispatched a team selected from your usual group{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉·戴维斯已经在大使馆卧底{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah Davies is already under cover…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.14,0:05:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·哈门可以破解所有的安全系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack Harmon can hack into any security system…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉娜·威廉斯善于监视{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hannah Williams will handle surveillance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.77,0:05:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的太太克莱尔负责掩护和交通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your wife, Claire, will cover transport…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.65,0:05:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有伊森·亨特和往常一样做你的先锋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Ethan Hunt will be your point man as usual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.50,0:05:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在正在基辅 会在布拉格的指定地点会合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is now in Kievand will rendezvous in Prague…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.07,0:05:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你选的那个咖啡屋里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at a safe house of your choosing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.05,0:06:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,像往常一样 如果你或者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As always, should you or any member…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.40,0:06:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动小组的任何成员被逮捕或者被杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your l.M. force be caught or killed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长会否认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the secretary will disavow…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.53,0:06:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你们这次行动的知情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all knowledge of your actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.14,0:06:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这盘带子会在五秒钟之后自动销毁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This tape will self-destruct in five seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 吉姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, Jim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.08,0:06:34.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（布拉格）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.71,0:06:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务目标很简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very straight forward objective{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.70,0:06:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍下葛里森偷取 NOC 名单的过程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We photograph Golitsyn stealing the NOC list…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.22,0:06:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后跟踪他到交易地点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}follow him to his buyer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.48,0:06:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后把他们全部逮捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}apprehend both of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.01,0:06:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在说一下行动计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now here's the plot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.20,0:06:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 你改扮之后进入大使馆参加酒会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, you're going into the embassy in character during a party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.89,0:06:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量引起注意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide in plain sight highest possible profile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.86,0:06:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样可以吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会再有更好的方式了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't have it any other way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.69,0:07:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 你也要参加酒会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, you're at the party already…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.47,0:07:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,做为大使馆的华盛顿来宾的联络员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the embassy's Washington visitor liaison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.76,0:07:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,和伊森接触{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make contact with Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.13,0:07:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和他一起行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll run the game together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有酒会上的穿戴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't a thing to wear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.37,0:07:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 我相信你会弄到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sure you'll work it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.92,0:07:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要在葛里森身上做个记号 然后告诉汉娜他的位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll Mark Golitsyn, hand him off to Hannah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉娜 你要在酒会期间一直监视他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hannah, you'll have him for the duration of the interior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.09,0:07:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,找一个有利的位置然后盯住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find yourself a perch and stay on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.31,0:07:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jack - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.87,0:07:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,指纹认证系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fingerprint security{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.27,0:07:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入电梯前要通过这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's access through the elevator shaft here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.78,0:07:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我估计我是没机会穿礼服了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess I'm not wearing my tux.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.75,0:07:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,开启 关闭 然后离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open, close, get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.85,0:07:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要留下任何痕迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zero residual presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.87,0:07:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 你在外面的车内掩护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire, you're cover outside in the vehicle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛里森出来之后汉娜会和你一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hannah will join you as Golitsyn goes exterior…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.69,0:07:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个在那里监视他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you two stay on him from there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.55,0:07:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦出现了差错我会呼叫中止任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything goes wrong, I call abort{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.39,0:07:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人立即离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}everybody walk away immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.11,0:07:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,凌晨四点的时候在这里会合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regroup here at 4 a.m. That's 04:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么问题吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any questions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能弄个咖啡壶？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we get a cappuccino machine in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.85,0:07:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我都不知道 该怎么称呼这个难喝的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I don't know what you call this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.54,0:08:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我称它为痛苦残忍和不同寻常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call it cruel and unusual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.43,0:08:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些咖啡是我沏的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made that coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.81,0:08:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 它是不是比你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. Is it possible it's even worse…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.21,0:08:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在基辅的马厩里弄的污水还难喝？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}than that sludge you made in that barn in Kiev?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.26,0:08:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别嫌弃我太太沏的咖啡 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, take it easy on my wife's coffee, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.19,0:08:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在基辅很想念你 吉姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We missed you in Kiev, Jim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很想你 伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missed you, too, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.27,0:08:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是刚刚结束舒适的招募新人的任务？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off on one of your cushy recruiting assignments again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.55,0:08:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次他们让你住在哪儿了？纽约大饭店？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd they put you up this time? The Plaza?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.36,0:08:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝加哥德雷克大饭店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drake Hotel, Chicago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.83,0:08:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦！- 哦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ooh! - Ooh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.95,0:08:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,太舒适了！二十四小时客房服务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cushy! 24-hour room service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.99,0:08:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,配备私人司机的轿车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chauffeured cars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是一大笔报销单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fat expense account.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开始享受晚年的乐趣了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's getting soft in his old age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.73,0:08:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是 看看他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he is. Look at him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}O.K., listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.03,0:08:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这个名单流传出去并被公开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that list gets out into the open…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.01,0:08:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有在东欧国家的特工的名字…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the names of our agents in every country in Eastern Europe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会被第三世界的恐怖分子、 军火商、毒枭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be up for grabs to the highest bidders third world terrorists…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人轻松地高价入手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}arms dealers, drug lords…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.87,0:08:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一直都想除掉像我们这种隐蔽的特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}any and everybody who'd love to get rid of long-term coverts like us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.84,0:08:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦他们被暴露了 就会被处决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they're exposed, they'll be executed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我会在这里进行指挥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'll run the whole show from the crow's nest here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.86,0:08:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都清楚自己的角色任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone knows their roles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.21,0:08:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录一下详细资料吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's punch out the details.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.80,0:09:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼻梁右边设有相机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a camera built right into the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.47,0:09:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到的东西它都会采集到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you see, it sees…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.92,0:09:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后它会传送到这里 看见了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then it transmits it back here. See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,能听见我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.66,0:09:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然能听见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I can hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.98,0:09:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的 在你的… 喔 你需要一个听筒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, in your… Oh, you need an earpiece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.81,0:09:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.36,0:09:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼睛很迷人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have lovely eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在能听见我了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.99,0:09:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,响亮且清晰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loud and clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他开车跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he has a car waiting, and he rolls…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.75,0:09:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无论如何都要跟住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you stay with him no matter what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.60,0:09:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该利用下午时间 多开车逛逛这个地区的街道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should take the afternoon drive the streets around this little quarter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会疯狂地绕路的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're confusing as hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.42,0:09:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我一个上午都做了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think I've been doing all morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要装扮成沃尔策？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're using Waltzer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.83,0:09:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我们的人啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's our guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没在主持军方听证会？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't he chairing the Armed Services hearing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.91,0:09:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这周{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.94,0:09:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个星期他飞去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This week, he's fly fishing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,基尔代尔郡的奥特阿德沼泽钓鱼去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the Oughterard Slough in County Kildare…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.86,0:09:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着我们一个最好的爱尔兰导游{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with one of our best lrish guides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.02,0:09:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 而且他肯定不会马上回来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup. And he won't be back anytime soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.06,0:09:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,…顶多是跑题了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…irrelevant at best…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者最差的情况是违反了宪法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or unconstitutional at worst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.59,0:09:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言 议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect, Senator…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.23,0:10:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想发起的指控听起来很像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it sounds as if you want to lead the kind of charge…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.41,0:10:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克·丘奇议员在1970年的那次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Senator Frank Church led in the 1970s…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.76,0:10:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那次导致了这个国家情报机能的毁坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in the process destroy the intelligence capability of this country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.05,0:10:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 现在我只是想知道那些人是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Now, I want to know who these people are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.54,0:10:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他们是如何挥霍纳税人的钱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and how they're spending our taxpayers' money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.11,0:10:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再次重申 我们是生活在民主社会里的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were living in a democracy the last time I checked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一块口香糖 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick of gum, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.88,0:10:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.88,0:10:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的 红灯 绿灯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Red light, green light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.15,0:10:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你碰到打不开的锁时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come up against a lock you can't pick…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把它们揉在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you mash them together{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万不要弄到自己身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hasta lasagna, don't get any on ya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.60,0:10:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大概有五秒钟的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have about five seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.06,0:10:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,可别嚼了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't chew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 杰克已经就位了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, Jack's inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.79,0:11:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.05,0:11:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 议员？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you do, Senator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.10,0:11:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是兰特·奥斯曼 大使的副官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Rand Housman, the ambassador's aide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 兰特·奥斯曼先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Mr. Housman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.81,0:11:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,歌剧怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was the opera?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.07,0:11:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很无聊的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it was boring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.11,0:11:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我带您先进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see if I can steer you through this reception line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.27,0:11:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 议员？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you do, Senator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.25,0:11:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的太太 里德夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His wife, Mrs. Reed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.70,0:11:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在2300端口上打开视窗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Windows open by 2300.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.97,0:11:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕特·布兰 布拉格市长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Petr Brandl, the mayor of Prague…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好！- 还有布兰夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you do? - and Mrs. Brandl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.68,0:11:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.72,0:12:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌你已经认不得我了 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you don't remember me, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.95,0:12:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然认得 你好啊 诺曼小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I do. How are you, Miss Norman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.13,0:12:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经确认他在楼梯那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in pocket, on the stairway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.21,0:12:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛里森先生 真高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Golitsyn, nice to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.75,0:12:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hannah…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,去掉颜色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}pull the shade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.74,0:12:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 在目标上做标记 然后去二楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, mark the package and go to two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.75,0:12:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的高级小组 提起您喜欢在交通工具上观光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your advance team mentioned you'd like a tour of the facility…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们就去装配一个吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I've gone ahead and set one up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.56,0:12:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,请这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:12:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.97,0:13:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里通往大使馆里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which leads to the denied area…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.61,0:13:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的管制区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only limited-access area in the whole facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.93,0:13:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,管理员现在要过去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Governor's in position now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.33,0:13:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我可以帮忙吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.85,0:13:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.89,0:13:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你看到的 这里有保安 还有监视器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, there's a marine guard and video surveillance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就好像… 不好意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is like…Excuse me. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.97,0:13:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道它就在包里的某个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's in here somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.86,0:13:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,上士 你在晚会上为什么不穿制服？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant, why are you not in your uniform this evening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.35,0:13:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们奉命穿着便装{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we've been ordered to wear civilian clothes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.74,0:14:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是这个晚上 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this evening, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.51,0:14:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.66,0:14:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,议员 请告诉我你的手下有叫杰克的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, Senator, do you have someone on your staff named Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.49,0:14:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克？我们的确有个叫做杰克的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack? Uh, we did have a Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.81,0:14:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个很不可靠的家伙 记得他经常迟到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An unreliable fellow, as I recallconstantly late…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.55,0:14:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且工作拖沓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and behind in his work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.70,0:14:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们强行把他系在好马后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were forced to tie him behind one of my best stallions…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.33,0:14:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖着他绕着我的谷仓走了好几天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and drag him around my barn for a few days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要急啊 我正在处理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax your crack, Foghorn. I'm working on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.40,0:14:34.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（档案输入警卫站）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.20,0:14:40.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（身份符合：准许进入）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.93,0:14:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.22,0:14:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 晚上愉快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Have a nice evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.80,0:14:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.03,0:15:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和莎拉的约会肯定是没戏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That date with Sarah is definitely off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.76,0:15:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,再高点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Higher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.90,0:15:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他往管制区那里去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's heading to the denied area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.07,0:15:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 伊森，{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get moving, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.53,0:15:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他往你那里去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's rolling to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.32,0:15:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.02,0:16:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 我们已经就位了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, we're in position here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.03,0:16:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.17,0:16:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我弄的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't touch it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的外衣哪儿去了？出去会很冷的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about my coat? I'll freeze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 快打开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, open the doors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.42,0:16:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在电梯里 伊森 他已经在电梯里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in the box, Ethan. He's in the box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.31,0:16:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}O.K…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.31,0:16:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就快和葛里森碰上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking Golitsyn's exit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.07,0:16:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快打开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open these doors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.51,0:16:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在也没办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.58,0:16:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来开门吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm opening the doors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.02,0:16:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,从底下走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go under.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.32,0:16:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.79,0:17:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经拿到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.49,0:17:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又救了你这混蛋一命 杰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saved your ass again, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我休息一下 老爹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a break, pops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.90,0:17:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么好的一个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a nice ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.34,0:17:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是个寂寞的混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a lonely ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.61,0:17:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟后到车上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transport in five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.16,0:17:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 我们就位了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, we're in position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.57,0:18:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开门让目标出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the doors and let the package roll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.30,0:18:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 正在开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that. Opening doors now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.52,0:18:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉娜 你的任务完成了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stairway, you're wrapped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.68,0:18:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,到车上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to transport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.83,0:18:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.54,0:18:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 你在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.54,0:18:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没做啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not doing anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.85,0:18:39.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（系统处理有误）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.93,0:18:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法控制了 杰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have control, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.73,0:18:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我麻烦大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, then I got a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.35,0:18:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断电源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.62,0:18:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断电源 杰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the power, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.10,0:18:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 杰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.91,0:18:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断电源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.43,0:18:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.56,0:18:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.31,0:19:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.31,0:19:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.31,0:19:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.01,0:19:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 收到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.27,0:19:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.14,0:19:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,队员牺牲了 伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man down, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.99,0:19:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.56,0:19:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 待在现在的位置别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, stay where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.89,0:19:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标已经离开大使馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The package is out in the open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.32,0:20:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.44,0:20:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经在使馆外面了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's in the open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.59,0:20:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在路上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}En route.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.00,0:20:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 他已经在使馆外面了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, he's in the open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.86,0:20:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 目标已经在使馆外面了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, the package is in the open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.60,0:20:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被跟踪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.52,0:20:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能甩掉他吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you lose him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.21,0:20:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 中止任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Abort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.07,0:20:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 他要离开控制范围了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, he's out of pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.75,0:20:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能跟踪他吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.01,0:20:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们中埋伏了 伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're being ambushed, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.80,0:20:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,中止任务 这是命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abort. That's an order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.05,0:20:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拒绝 葛里森正在行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative. Golitsyn is on the move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.72,0:20:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 混蛋！不行！我说了中止任务！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, damn it! No! I said abort!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.37,0:21:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 盯住目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, eye on the package.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 我现在往你那里去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, I'm coming to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.61,0:21:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆已经说中止任务了 我们应该马上离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim gave an abort. We should walk away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.51,0:21:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我们必须取回那张磁盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We are going to recover that disk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.49,0:21:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.67,0:21:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.70,0:21:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.61,0:21:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,离桥大概二百码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 200 yards from the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.58,0:21:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们监听了我们的波段{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're covering this frequency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.98,0:21:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉所有无线电通讯工具{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut all radio communication.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.57,0:22:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复一遍 关掉所有无线电通讯工具{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat Cut all radio communication.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.04,0:22:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.98,0:22:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.92,0:23:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.33,0:23:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,中止任务 重复一遍 中止任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abort. Repeat…abort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.07,0:23:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,中止任务！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abort!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.13,0:23:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你收到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you read me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.40,0:23:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.09,0:23:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.92,0:23:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.93,0:23:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我的天呐！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.79,0:23:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.42,0:24:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.84,0:24:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不… 莎拉…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no…Sarah…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.45,0:25:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,第七号卫星通信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satcom Seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.34,0:25:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,中欧 信号未加密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Central Europe, unsecured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.43,0:25:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,代码？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Designator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.84,0:25:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,BE11{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo Echo One One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.12,0:25:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,转接中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.93,0:25:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是奇佐治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Kittridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.51,0:25:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,先加密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go secure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.02,0:25:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}O.K., go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.93,0:25:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是伊森·亨特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Ethan Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.03,0:26:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.36,0:26:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁死了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Who's dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.02,0:26:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的队员！我的队员全死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My team. My team is dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.28,0:26:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.31,0:26:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛里森死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Golitsyn's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.03,0:26:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道我们要来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They knew we were coming, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.86,0:26:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道我们要来 磁盘也被拿走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They knew we were coming, and the disk is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.64,0:26:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没受伤吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you intact?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.81,0:26:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,磁盘被拿走了 你听明白了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The disk is gone, do you read me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.58,0:26:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,名单外流了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The list is in the open!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.63,0:26:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我听明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I read you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.49,0:26:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先把你带到安全的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just bring you in safely…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.69,0:26:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再担心那些 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we'll worry about that, O.K.?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.22,0:26:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人跟踪你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you followed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.87,0:26:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该没有 应该没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so. I…I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.79,0:26:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要应该 要确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think. Be sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.89,0:26:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没受伤吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you clean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.52,0:26:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.67,0:26:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 一个小时之后 代号绿地点见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}O.K. Location green, one hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.43,0:26:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会单独去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.13,0:26:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在布拉格？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in Prague?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.60,0:26:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小时之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.67,0:27:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.13,0:27:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么表达我有多么的遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you how, uh, sorry I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.70,0:27:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道吉姆对你非常特别 伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how much Jim, in particular, meant to you, Ethan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.94,0:27:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是私人关系还是工作关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}personally as well as professionally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.41,0:27:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.22,0:27:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.91,0:28:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,护照、维萨信用卡 和平常一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}passport, visa. Usual drill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.75,0:28:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会到加拿大的兰里 听取你们这次行动详细情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll work the exfiltration through Canada debrief you at Langley…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.18,0:28:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后扔几个骨头给布拉格警方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}throw the Prague police a bone or two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.24,0:28:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 交出几个嫌疑犯就没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, toss them a few suspects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.96,0:28:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我一起吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You follow me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.09,0:28:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我和你一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.84,0:28:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这个晚上 我们已经失去太多的特工了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we've lost enough agents for one night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.77,0:28:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我这个晚上 失去了太多的特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, I've lost enough agents for one night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.49,0:28:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像在责怪自己 伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem hell-bent on blaming yourself, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.78,0:28:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁活下来了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else is left?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.76,0:28:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我明白你的意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I see your point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.44,0:28:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么那里还有其他的小组？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why was there another team?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.91,0:28:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.78,0:28:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,IMF 的特工今晚在大使馆里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of IMF agents at the embassy tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.35,0:28:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是很明白你的意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't quite follow you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.64,0:29:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个店里的人你就明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's see if you can follow me around the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.53,0:29:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,七点钟到八点钟方向的 是堤旁的那个俄国醉汉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The drunk Russians on the embankment at 7:00 and 8:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.30,0:29:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,九点钟到十一点钟方向的 是那对围着我跳华尔兹的夫妇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The couple waltzing around me at the embassy at 9 and 11.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.06,0:29:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二点钟的打蝴蝶结的 是在楼梯上面站在汉娜后面的服务生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The waiter standing behind Hannah at the top of the stairs bow tie, 12:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.07,0:29:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,IMF 的另一个小组{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other IMF team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.44,0:29:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在担心我 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're worried about me. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.06,0:29:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,近两年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, for a little over two years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.50,0:29:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 IMF 的任务经常被破坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've been spotting serious blowback in IMF operations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.31,0:29:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人渗透了进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a penetration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.79,0:29:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,前几天 我们在互联网上解码了一个消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other day, we decoded a message on the lnternet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.31,0:29:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,由一个被称作马克斯的捷克人发出的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a Czech we know as "Max."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.91,0:29:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个军火商{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The arms dealer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.54,0:29:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.29,0:29:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来马克斯好像有两个独特的天赋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max, it seems, has two unique gifts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.90,0:29:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐藏身份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a capacity for anonymity…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.77,0:29:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,和收买特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for corrupting susceptible agents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.89,0:29:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次他好像接触到了内部的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time, he'd gotten to someone on the inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.11,0:29:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是要购买 NOC 名单的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd gotten himself in a position to buy our NOC list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.76,0:30:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从内线得知了「314 行动」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An operation he referred to as job 314{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.29,0:30:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为就是葛里森今晚要执行的任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the job he thought Golitsyn was doing tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.15,0:30:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是葛里森偷走的那个名单是个诱饵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the list Golitsyn stole was a decoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.98,0:30:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个是假的 真的名单在兰里受到了严密保护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's correct. The actual list is secure at Langley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.34,0:30:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛里森只是个幌子 他是我们的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Golitsyn was a lightning rod. He's one of ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.26,0:30:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次的整个行动是为了清除叛徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole operation was a molehunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.38,0:30:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次的整个行动是为了清除叛徒…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole operation was a molehunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.21,0:30:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.64,0:30:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常狡猾的叛徒…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mole's deep inside…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.08,0:30:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且就像你说过的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and like you said…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.12,0:30:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你幸存下来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.07,0:30:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想给你看些东西 伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to show you something, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.96,0:30:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从你父亲过世之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since your father's death…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.61,0:30:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家的农场就在进行破产清算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your family's farm has been in receivership…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.99,0:31:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在 突然之间 银行帐户里多出了十二万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now, suddenly, they're flush with over 120 grand in the bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.62,0:31:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲的病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father's illness…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.71,0:31:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该已经 把银行帐户里的钱用光了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was supposed to have wiped out that bank account.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.73,0:31:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟他在美国是病了好长时间才死的 肯定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dying slowly in America, after all…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.47,0:31:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,花费了很多的积蓄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}can be a very expensive proposition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.81,0:31:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.06,0:31:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么现在我们 不安静地离开这里去坐飞机呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}why don't we quietly get out of here and onto a plane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.12,0:31:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能明白你现在非常伤心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can understand you're very upset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.27,0:31:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇佐治 你从没见过我伤心的样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kittridge, you've never seen me very upset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.25,0:31:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 亨特 够了够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Hunt. Enough is enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.06,0:31:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受贿、诈骗、谋杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have bribed, cajoled, and killed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.01,0:31:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你利用自己人之间的信任做出了这些事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you have done it using loyalties on the inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.39,0:31:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想与恶魔握手 这对我来说无所谓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to shake hands with the devil, that's fine with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.81,0:31:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想确认你究竟做没做这些事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to make sure that you do it in hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.48,0:33:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱 钱在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Money, money. Where's the damn money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.73,0:34:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,前几天 我们在互联网上解码了一个消息…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other day, we decoded a message on the lnternet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.51,0:34:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,由一个被称作马克斯的捷克人发出的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a Czech we know as "Max."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.23,0:34:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是要购买 NOC 名单的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd gotten himself in a position to buy our NOC list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.16,0:34:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从内线得知了「314 行动」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An operation he referred to as job 314.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.98,0:34:28.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（连接网络）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.18,0:34:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,314 行动…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Job 314…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.38,0:34:37.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（未搜索到该字符串）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.29,0:34:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,314 行动 找不到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Job… 314. I can't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.62,0:34:46.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马克斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.78,0:34:49.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（未搜索到该字符串）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.58,0:34:56.46,Note,0,0,0,0,,（行动）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.46,0:34:58.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（未搜索到该字符串）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.27,0:35:06.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（滚动新闻组网络系统）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.20,0:35:19.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣经）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.59,0:35:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,约伯记 3：14？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Job 3:14?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.72,0:35:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,约伯记 3：14…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Job 3:14…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.45,0:35:42.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（3：13 不然 我就早已躺卧安睡）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.34,0:35:45.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（3：14 和地上为自己重造荒丘荒邱的君王、谋士）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.35,0:35:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.52,0:35:54.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（搜索：圣经）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.03,0:35:57.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（找到 126 项指定内容）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.68,0:36:01.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（搜索：约伯记）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.65,0:36:04.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（约伯记讨论组 3章 14节）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.14,0:36:09.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（收件人：马克斯 | 寄件人：约伯）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.05,0:36:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.04,0:36:18.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（货物已受污染 非常危险 千万不要用）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.12,0:36:25.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（世上的君主和智者）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.05,0:36:27.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（建造现已颓倒的殿堂）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.16,0:36:33.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（必须马上当面会谈）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.59,0:37:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.33,0:37:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.83,0:37:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你来帮忙 伊森 我要你来桥上救我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed you, Ethan. I needed you on the bridge…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.46,0:37:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你没去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you weren't there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.24,0:37:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.21,0:37:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.88,0:37:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.45,0:37:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.65,0:38:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.93,0:38:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, it's O.K.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.73,0:38:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.90,0:38:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是克莱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Claire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.23,0:38:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's O.K.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.96,0:38:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时在车上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.93,0:38:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我没在车上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I wasn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.83,0:38:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在无线电里听到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard on the radio{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.27,0:38:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！我看到你了 你当时在车上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! I saw you. You were in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.10,0:38:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我后来从车里出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I got out of the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.88,0:38:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跑向桥那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran to the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.75,0:38:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说有人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said someone was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.34,0:38:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用骗我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.45,0:38:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时就在桥上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.32,0:38:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,桥上没有一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was nobody on the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.05,0:38:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆发生了什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to Jim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.21,0:38:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒吧 克莱尔 吉姆死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, Claire! Jim's dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.58,0:38:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们死了 他们都死了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead! They're all dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.86,0:38:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁派你来找我的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who sent you for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.50,0:38:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆死了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim's dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.13,0:38:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁派你来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who sent you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.33,0:38:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.47,0:38:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱掉你的外衣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take off your coat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.48,0:39:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.95,0:39:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.01,0:39:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Where were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.82,0:39:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I walked away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.99,0:39:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说中止任务 我就离开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said abort. I just…walked away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.96,0:39:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是四个小时之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was four hours ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.67,0:39:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁派你来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who sent you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.13,0:39:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们派你来找我的吗？- 他们指谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did they send you for me? - Who's "they"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.18,0:39:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们派你来的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they send you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.57,0:39:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁派你来的？谁派你来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, who sent you? Who sent you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.61,0:39:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有谁派我来 没有谁派我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one sent me. No one sent me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.20,0:39:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当时定好四点回到这里的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were supposed to be back here at 4:00, 4:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.37,0:39:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们失败了 我们就四点之后回到这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we abort, we don't return here until 4:00, 0400, 4 a.m.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.26,0:39:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,四点 伊森 四点…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}4:00, Ethan. 4:00…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.75,0:39:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们失败了… 四点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we abort…4 a.m.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.94,0:40:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被逐出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been disavowed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.07,0:40:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们竟然认为是我杀的吉姆和其他人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They actually think I killed Jim and everyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.22,0:40:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道为什么有十万美元 被发现存到我父母的银号帐户里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow $100, 000 finds its way into my parents' bank account.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.52,0:40:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇佐治已经认定 我就是那个他们要查的叛徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kittridge assumes I'm the mole they've been tracing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.98,0:40:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我就是被那个 叫马克斯的军火商雇佣的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've been in the employ of an arms dealer, Max…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.19,0:40:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这两年为他偷取我们的 NOC 名单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the last two years… to get him our NOC list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.81,0:40:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接下来准备怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you going to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.88,0:40:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算去了解一下他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to get it for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.03,0:40:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 你这么做没有任何意义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, you're not making any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.27,0:40:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管叛徒是谁…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever the mole is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.62,0:40:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得应该从行动的名称查起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think goes by the name of Job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.72,0:40:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我虽然找不到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.40,0:40:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果他知道我有 NOC 名单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if he knows I have the NOC list…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.01,0:40:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会来找我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll find me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.25,0:40:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回去亲自和奇佐治说明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to go in and I'm going to talk to Kittridge myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.49,0:40:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉他 你和这件事没有任何关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell him you had nothing to do with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.49,0:41:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 只要你没死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire, if you're not dead…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.27,0:41:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就会认为你和我是同伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's going to assume you're with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.84,0:41:08.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（讯息等候中）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.15,0:41:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,发给约伯的消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The message is for Job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.02,0:41:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.44,0:41:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我会去答复它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm going to answer it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.68,0:41:29.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一点在那卡赞卡街和普里考培街的拐角）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.96,0:41:33.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（买包登喜路香烟 然后和坐在汽车站长椅上的男人借火）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.25,0:41:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.10,0:41:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以麻烦你借个火吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I trouble you for a match?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.42,0:42:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以摘下你的帽子吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you remove your hat, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.03,0:42:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.58,0:42:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想见到马克斯吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wish to meet Max?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.09,0:42:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是准许见面的代价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The price of admission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.12,0:42:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想见的是马克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was going to see Max.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.81,0:42:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你误会了 没有人能见到马克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You misunderstood. No one sees Max.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.40,0:42:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我来这里做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what the hell am I doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.02,0:42:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,让马克斯见见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allowing Max to see you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.03,0:42:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后听听你有什么说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hear what you've got to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.23,0:42:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不习惯带着头罩和别人交流{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't communicate very well through a shroud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.90,0:42:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果马克斯不满意你所说的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if Max doesn't like what you have to say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.13,0:42:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会永远带着那个头罩了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll be wearing that shroud indefinitely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.04,0:42:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想碰碰运气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm willing to take the chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.23,0:43:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.17,0:43:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？你来这里做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you and what are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.83,0:43:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要十五万美元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need $150, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.52,0:43:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha ha. Oh, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.56,0:43:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…You…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.69,0:43:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you thought…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.20,0:43:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要简单地开个价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you simply showed up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.58,0:43:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会拱手给你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might give it to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.92,0:43:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不会？你给了约伯125万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not? You gave Job 125.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.28,0:43:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm…the penny drops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.65,0:43:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是约伯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not Job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.23,0:43:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,约伯在联络消息里不喜欢引用圣经{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Job is not given to quoting scripture in his communications.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.38,0:43:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那个语气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there was its tone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.52,0:43:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很强硬却又有点幽默{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}aggressive but playful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.97,0:43:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,约伯一点也不幽默的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Job is not playful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.39,0:43:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你那些话很矛盾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you are something of a paradox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.39,0:44:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那取决于…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that depends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.84,0:44:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.60,0:44:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜不喜欢矛盾喽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether you like a paradox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.58,0:44:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天就要拿到十五万美元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want $150, 000 today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.75,0:44:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 那绝对不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, no. That's quite out of the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.53,0:44:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,约伯卖给你的磁盘一文不值{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The disk Job sold you it's worthless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.51,0:44:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个诱饵 用来清除内部叛徒的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's baitpart of an internal molehunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.06,0:44:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么知道这些的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how might you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.73,0:44:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是另一个内部的人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you another company man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.42,0:44:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像约伯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.11,0:44:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.78,0:44:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在问你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're asking about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.30,0:44:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是 NOC{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm NOC{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.05,0:44:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经是 现在被逐出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was …Now disavowed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.85,0:44:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 我可以问问吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, may I ask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.03,0:44:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是我想问约伯的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the question I want to ask Job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.31,0:45:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解约伯的程度不比他了解我的多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know Job any more than Job knows me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.28,0:45:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.74,0:45:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你也能安排我们认识一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you could arrange an introduction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.43,0:45:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要这么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should l?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.77,0:45:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我能拿出一份真正的 NOC 名单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I can deliver the actual NOC list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.22,0:45:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿到的那个不但一文不值{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one you have is not only worthless…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.57,0:45:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且肯定还装上了跟踪装置 用来定位你们的精确位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's certain to be equipped with a homing device to pinpoint your exact location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.84,0:45:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 哼…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.99,0:45:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,用一下这张盘试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boot it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.98,0:45:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论在哪里 只要用三十秒到十分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In anywhere from 30 seconds to 10 minutes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.11,0:45:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后就会有弗吉尼亚农夫像野兔一样一直围着你转了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll have Virginia farmboys hopping around you like jackrabbits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.62,0:45:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这张磁盘贬成一文不值很容易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's easy to say the disk is worthless…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.81,0:45:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又说我不能查看它的内容 这可站不住脚啊 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you say I can't look at the information not a tenable position, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.97,0:45:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那你就用吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}O.K., use it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.32,0:45:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.04,0:45:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你先收拾好东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd suggest you pack first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.02,0:46:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,26、27 到目前为止都还不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}26-27. So far, so good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.26,0:46:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说不是好消息 我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so good for you, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.37,0:46:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有两分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say you've got about two minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.25,0:46:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,32 33{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}32 and 33.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.08,0:46:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean it's a signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.40,0:46:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是硬盘的发热{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could just be the hard drive heating up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.65,0:46:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,44 45{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}44 and 45.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.72,0:47:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.76,0:47:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他人已经躲起来了 巴恩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man's gone black, Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.35,0:47:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有他想露面时才能找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's under until he decides to surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.83,0:47:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以利用大使馆的人 包括地方当局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can use somebody at the embassy. Involve the local authorities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.44,0:47:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以切断他的交通…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can cut off his transportation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.52,0:47:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能怎么做 巴恩斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can we do, Barnes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.24,0:48:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在机场派人守着？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put a guy at the airport?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.50,0:48:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道亨特同时有着多少个身份吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many identities do you think Hunt has?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.75,0:48:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,从多少个国家的海关 神不知鬼不觉地溜过去多少次吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times has he slipped past customs in how many countries?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.59,0:48:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙被训练的像幽灵一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys are trained to be ghosts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.72,0:48:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们把他们训练成这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We taught them to do it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.88,0:48:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在老天的份上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Christ's sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.07,0:48:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你说该怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you suggest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.11,0:48:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能浪费时间追捕他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not waste time chasing after him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.63,0:48:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要让他主动来找我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's make him come to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.28,0:48:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有弱点的 巴恩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody has pressure points, Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.38,0:48:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去找出来对他来讲最重要的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find something that's personally important to him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.69,0:48:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就施压{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you squeeze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.22,0:48:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,巩特尔再也不会让我借用他的公寓了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunther will never let me have one of his apartments again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.72,0:48:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才怀疑了你 我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I doubted you, dear boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.33,0:48:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很有风度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a good sport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.01,0:48:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 马克斯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Max.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.35,0:48:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是该叫你玛克辛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is it Maxine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.99,0:48:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有必要回答你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha. I don't have to tell you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.20,0:48:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,干我这行隐姓埋名会让人很安心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what a comfort anonymity can be in my profession.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.81,0:48:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一个取暖的毛毯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a warm blanket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.67,0:49:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和约伯交易的条件是 磁盘必须能成功的完成引导检测{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My deal with Job was subject to a successful boot scan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.09,0:49:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显它不符合要求 交易取消了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously it didn't pass muster. Deal's off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.55,0:49:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给约伯开的价是多少？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was your deal with Job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.26,0:49:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,六百万美元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…$6 million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.15,0:49:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会给你这么多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you the same…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.58,0:49:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我想要完整的名单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I want the complete list now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.86,0:49:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是东欧部分的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not just Eastern Europe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.03,0:49:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事太危险了 我不想一次次地干了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't do this piecemeal. It's too dangerous. I want entirelessed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.77,0:49:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.55,0:49:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千万可兑现的美国国库券{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 million in negotiable U.S. Treasury certificates…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.22,0:49:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不记名 附上息票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in bearer form, coupons attached…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.51,0:49:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还有一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one more thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.56,0:49:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须保证…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your personal assurance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.79,0:49:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,约伯也在交易现场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Job will be at the exchange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.05,0:49:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.58,0:49:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.77,0:49:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克斯和你做了笔生意？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max made a deal with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.68,0:49:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要交出 NOC 名单 马克斯就交出约伯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deliver the NOC list, Max delivers Job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.18,0:50:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了75发用于你那把贝瑞塔手枪的子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got 75 rounds for your Beretta…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.40,0:50:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是却只找到20发席格索尔手枪的子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but only 20 for the Sig Sauer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.83,0:50:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一副装有监视器的 Visco 牌眼镜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One pair of Visco glasses with monitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.08,0:50:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多的护照 还有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plenty of passports, and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.89,0:50:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.03,0:50:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己说过的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it yourself…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.53,0:50:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没死 他们就会认为我和你是同伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I'm not dead, I'm with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.18,0:50:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的要这么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.31,0:50:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆是我的丈夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim was my husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.24,0:50:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想找出来是哪个混蛋干的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to get the son of a bitch who did this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.05,0:50:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会需要一些帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to need some help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.82,0:50:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有太多的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have a lot of time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.07,0:50:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以帮手必须要在本地找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they're going to have to be local.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.46,0:50:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要什么样的帮忙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.65,0:50:42.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（输入类别 已被逐出人员）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.28,0:51:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单的游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.62,0:51:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,四个玩家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four players.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.73,0:51:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个负责打开目标入口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exfil opens the pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.66,0:51:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个负责偷出来钱包{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyber Ops lifts the wallet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.58,0:51:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,银行？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.80,0:51:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,IMF 主机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}IMF mainframe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.87,0:51:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,确切位置在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where exactly is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.58,0:51:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在兰里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Langley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.03,0:51:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在兰里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Langley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.40,0:51:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗吉尼亚的兰里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one in Virginia, Langley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.50,0:51:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在兰里的中央情报局总部里面？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside CIA headquarters at Langley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.78,0:51:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是认真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.71,0:51:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.90,0:51:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.01,0:51:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们要去弗吉尼亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're going to Virginia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.01,0:51:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么不顺便逛逛纳克斯堡金库？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}why don't we drop by Fort Knox?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.09,0:51:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以驾驶直升机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can fly a helicopter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.76,0:51:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,从门廊直穿过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}right in through the lobby…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.04,0:51:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后在金库的里面降落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and set it down inside the vault…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.60,0:52:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都比侵入 CIA 要简单很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it would be a hell of a lot easier than breaking into the goddamn CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.65,0:52:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要下载什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we downloading?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.80,0:52:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,资料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.64,0:52:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么资料？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.04,0:52:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有用的资料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Profitable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.26,0:52:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,交货时付款{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payment on delivery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.11,0:52:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.76,0:52:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不很确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.96,0:52:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这看起来可不像我听说的路德·斯帝盖尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this doesn't sound like the Luther Stickell I heard of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.66,0:52:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么称呼你的 是「网络骑兵」吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they call you, the Net Ranger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.98,0:52:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是「线上的菲尼亚斯」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phineas Phreak?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.60,0:52:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上唯一真正侵入了北约「幽灵网络系统」的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only man alive who actually hacked NATO Ghostcom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.58,0:52:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有任何证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was never any physical evidence…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.43,0:52:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,能证明我参与过那件…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I had anything to do with that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.35,0:52:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那件…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.32,0:52:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那件极为杰出的作品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that exceptional piece of work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.86,0:52:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不知道你将要错过的是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what you're missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.74,0:52:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是黑客世界的珠穆朗玛峰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Mount Everest of hacks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.59,0:52:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是在哄你自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all kidding yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.87,0:52:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算用最顶级的新型解码器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with top of the line crypto…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.55,0:52:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,存取器、3S 测试系统…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}cray access, STU 3s{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.38,0:52:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里格能弄到手 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krieger can get it, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.18,0:53:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会花一些时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May take a little time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.36,0:53:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,「一些时间」是指什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do you mean, "a little time"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.69,0:53:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔向我 介绍你的时候可没说过这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what Claire tells me about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.84,0:53:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要台笔记本电脑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinking-machine laptops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.64,0:53:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说那种带有 人工智能保险芯片的 686 型{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about the 686 prototypes with the artificial intelligence risk chip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.20,0:53:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,24小时之内弄到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}24 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.91,0:53:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.61,0:53:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,完事的时候我要留下那些设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get to keep the equipment when we're done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.09,0:53:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德 我猜你现在已经没有借口了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther, I guess you're all out of excuses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.43,0:53:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.88,0:53:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.91,0:53:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能用我以前的方法入侵系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't hack my way inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.83,0:53:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,主机上没有装调制解调器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, there's no modem access to the mainframe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.37,0:53:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是一个独立的系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in what we call the stand alone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.75,0:53:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要真正地在终端上操作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means I'll have to be physically at the terminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.96,0:53:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松些 路德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, Luther.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.08,0:53:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实比你想像的糟糕多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's much worse than you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.45,0:53:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,终端放置于密闭的保险库中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The terminal is in a black vault lockdown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.60,0:53:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一允许进入那个房间的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only person allowed in the room…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.33,0:53:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须经过一连串的安全检查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has to pass through a series of security checks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.98,0:53:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉·丹罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}William Donloe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.01,0:54:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一项检查是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first is a voiceprint identification…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.20,0:54:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,声波纹识别和六位的密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a six-digit access code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.94,0:54:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这项只能让他进入外层房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This only gets him into the outer room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.52,0:54:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来 他必须通过视网膜扫瞄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next, he has to pass a retinal scan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.61,0:54:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后 只有使用一个双精度电子密钥卡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And finally, the intrusion countermeasures…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.33,0:54:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能解除入侵防范系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are only deactivated by a double electronic key card…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.37,0:54:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有那张卡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which we won't have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.10,0:54:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入保险库之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, inside the black vault…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.48,0:54:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有三个运行着的系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are three systems operating…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.25,0:54:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要操作员离开房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whenever the technician is out of the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.31,0:54:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个声音感应系统就启动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first is sound sensitive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.09,0:54:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何稍微大一点的声音都会触发它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything above a whisper sets it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.27,0:54:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二个系统检测温度的增长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second system detects any increase in temperature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.67,0:54:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,未经授权进入室内的人的体温{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the body heat of an unauthorized person in the room…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.45,0:54:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会触发它…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will trigger it if the temperature rises…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.20,0:54:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕才仅仅一度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just a single degree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.03,0:55:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,温度是由装在距离地面三十英尺的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That temperature is controlled by the air-conditioning…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.02,0:55:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,高架管道上的空气调节装置控制的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}coming in through an overhead duct 30 feet above the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.07,0:55:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个通风口由激光网防护着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That vent is guarded by a laser net.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.03,0:55:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三个系统是 装在地面上的压感探测装置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The third system is on the floor and is pressure sensitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.33,0:55:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,重量的轻微增长就会触发警报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The slightest increase in weight will trigger the alarm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.96,0:55:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且其中任何一个系统被触发 都会自动将房间封闭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and any one of these systems if set off, will activate an automatic lockdown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.01,0:55:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 先生们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…believe me when I tell you, gentlemen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.45,0:55:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所说的这三个系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all three systems…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.13,0:55:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,都代表了现今的最高科技水平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are state-of-the-art.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.91,0:55:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你真的认为我们能办得到？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you really think we can do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.87,0:55:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们办得到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.63,0:56:02.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（兰里）
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.97,0:56:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们收到在 3、7、12 区域有火警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We picked up alarms in sector 3, 7, and 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.79,0:56:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我也收到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's what I've got, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.08,0:56:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,空气调节装置在哪一区？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What sector's the air-conditioning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.58,0:56:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,21 区 但是 21 区没有火警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}21, but there's no alarm in sector 21.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.28,0:56:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须到那里把它关闭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to get in there and shut it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.05,0:56:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人都不能进入没有火警的区域{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody gets into any sector where an alarm hasn't gone off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.93,0:56:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让火势蔓延到整栋大楼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to blow the fire through this whole building?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.11,0:56:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 但是任何人都不能进入没有火警的区域{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one goes into any sector where the alarm hasn't gone off…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.76,0:56:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而且 21 区并没有火警 - 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and it hasn't gone off in 21. - Wait{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.66,0:56:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有火警了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.46,0:56:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走 - 开始行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - That's move, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.01,0:56:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,用我帮你带点东西吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get you anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.24,0:57:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.51,0:57:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,21 区就在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}21's through here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.07,0:57:11.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（后勤部）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.28,0:57:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在招募人手 为了什么目的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's recruiting. For what purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.96,0:57:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了生存{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.23,0:57:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,目光太短浅了 这个家伙开始行动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too shortsighted. This guy initiates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.26,0:57:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一般都主动出击的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's proactive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.49,0:57:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 他到底想要什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, what does he want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.64,0:57:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要在哪弄到它？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where does he need to get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.98,0:57:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴恩斯 那些该死的噪音是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barnes, what the hell's that noise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.48,0:57:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是火警 吉恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, fire alarm, Gene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.03,0:57:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须疏散吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have to evacuate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.63,0:58:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们本来有三个人的 另一个家伙哪去了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there were three of you. Where's the other guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.46,0:58:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zero body count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.93,0:58:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.37,1:00:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.25,1:01:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}1.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.86,1:01:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.51,1:01:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}3.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.37,1:01:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.08,1:01:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.68,1:01:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.31,1:01:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.99,1:01:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 路德 我要进去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}O.K., Luther, I'm going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.60,1:01:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,珠穆朗玛峰啊 老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everest, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.98,1:01:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好在上面插个旗帜了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready to plant the flag?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.09,1:01:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿嚏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah-choo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.06,1:01:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.28,1:01:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里格 从我进去的时候开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krieger, from here on in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.76,1:01:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,要绝对地安静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}absolute silence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.60,1:02:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正在往你们那里去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's rolling to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.33,1:03:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正在声波纹的那个走廊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's at the voiceprint corridor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.49,1:03:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉·丹罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}William Donloe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.93,1:03:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,外层房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outer room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.50,1:03:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正在进入保险库{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming in the vault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.95,1:03:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.60,1:04:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.68,1:04:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.18,1:05:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在厕所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in the bathroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.80,1:06:18.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（输入姓名 威廉·丹罗）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.24,1:06:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,A-W-9{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-W-9…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.74,1:06:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,6-B-6{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}6-B-6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.49,1:06:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣母玛利亚啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy mother of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.71,1:06:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,NOC名单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The NOC list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.26,1:07:53.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（下载至名单档）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.60,1:08:08.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（下载程序完成）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.82,1:09:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他进保险库里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's at the vault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.85,1:10:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,四格黄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four yellows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.42,1:10:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一格红{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.76,1:10:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.75,1:10:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,保佑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.24,1:10:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,保佑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.00,1:10:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法语] 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merci.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.43,1:11:25.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（按键记录 文件下载 9：58 AM）
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.10,1:11:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.93,1:11:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.28,1:11:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,打给… 你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's…for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.95,1:11:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇佐治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kittridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.30,1:12:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你和我知道这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I know about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.51,1:12:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事到此为止了 你明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where it stops, you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.65,1:12:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事从来就没有发生过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.09,1:12:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.09,1:12:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要他去阿拉斯加守雷达塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want him manning a radar tower in Alaska…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.24,1:12:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天就把他的衣服都寄过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the end of the day. Just mail him his clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.80,1:12:38.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伦敦）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.26,1:13:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正在联系你的买主？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You contacting your buyer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.03,1:13:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.00,1:13:15.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马克斯：或与有金子 将银子装满了房屋的王子一同安息）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.06,1:13:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.06,1:13:18.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马克斯：或与有金子 将银子装满了房屋的王子一同安息）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.11,1:13:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.57,1:13:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.30,1:13:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 亨特先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Mr. Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.35,1:13:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不带上我 你别想和任何人见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going to any meeting without me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.14,1:13:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的联络人非常地害羞的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My contact is extremely shy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.99,1:13:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 …{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.05,1:13:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你没有什么立场能命令我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you're in any position to give orders…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.65,1:13:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.16,1:13:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为手里有这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not while I'm holding this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.02,1:13:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里格…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krieger…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.36,1:14:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指这个吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you mean this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.87,1:14:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个并不是名单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.81,1:14:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 你从来没见过这个戏法吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter? You've never seen this trick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.62,1:14:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪去了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd it go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.09,1:14:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.53,1:14:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.24,1:14:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.18,1:14:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.78,1:14:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.51,1:14:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.44,1:14:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不会跑太远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not too far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.15,1:14:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你现在正在想什么 克里格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're thinking, Krieger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.74,1:14:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在回想当时主机房里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're thinking back in the computer room…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.36,1:14:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在上面 他在…他在下面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was up here, he was…he was down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.03,1:14:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 而且他还{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and he was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.76,1:14:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着两张盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was carrying two disks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.38,1:15:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难把这些事都记清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So hard to keep track of these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.74,1:15:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它哪去了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.17,1:15:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为我会让你拿到 NOC 名单吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you actually think l'd let you have the NOC list?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.33,1:15:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢对我的钱耍什么花招的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try any sleight of hand with my money…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.21,1:15:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就剪断你的喉咙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll cut your throat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.00,1:15:54.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（由犹太勇士放置于 芝加哥德雷克大饭店）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.83,1:15:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是刚刚结束舒适的招募新人的任务？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're off on one of your cushy recruiting assignments again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.40,1:15:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次他们让你住在哪儿了？纽约大饭店？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Where'd they put you up this time, the Plaza?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.77,1:16:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝加哥德雷克大饭店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drake Hotel, Chicago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.04,1:16:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.22,1:16:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里格是我找来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krieger was my call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.52,1:16:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.58,1:16:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都是不得已的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did what we had to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.64,1:16:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽量去睡会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to try and get some sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.96,1:17:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里格真的拿到了 NOC 名单？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krieger did have the NOC list?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.57,1:17:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我想让你拿好它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I want you to hold on to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.01,1:17:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你会相信我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you trust me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.38,1:17:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为如果一开始 你就知道要偷什么的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if you knew what you were getting into…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.51,1:17:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是绝不会参与的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you never would have done it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.71,1:17:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让这个流传出去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to let this get out in the open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.42,1:17:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是如此 这就是你明天在火车上的任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. That's your job tomorrow on the train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.96,1:17:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让这份 NOC 名单流传出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let this NOC list get out in the open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.50,1:17:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个东西的有效范围是多大？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the range of this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.05,1:17:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.64,1:17:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到时候必须尽量离近一些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to have to be close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.77,1:18:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 我得和你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, I need to talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.66,1:18:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The unlikely setting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.15,1:18:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在处于美国腹地的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a farm in the heartland of America…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.25,1:18:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,威斯康星州的一个农场里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the state of Wisconsin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.03,1:18:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦特工声称搜捕到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where federal agents claim to have found the brains…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.47,1:18:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个国际贩毒集团的幕后首脑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}behind an international drug ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.95,1:18:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,其活动是由玛格丽特·伊森·亨特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The operation was masterminded by Margaret Ethan Hunt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.37,1:18:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及其小叔子唐纳德·亨特策划的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and her brother-in-law Donald Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.62,1:18:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上缉毒官员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were arrested this morning…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.92,1:18:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在「长刺行动」中逮捕了他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by Drug Enforcement Officers in a major sting operation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.77,1:18:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次行动揭露了他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}designed to expose the illegal manufacture…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.26,1:18:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,非法加工俗称「猫」的麻药甲卡西酮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the drug methcathinone, known as Cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.47,1:18:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕在这里找到的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid what we have here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.43,1:19:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇佐治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kittridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.36,1:19:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见你公开拜访了我的家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you've been out visiting the folks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.34,1:19:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是亨特 找出他的精确位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Hunt. What do you need for a pinpoint?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.28,1:19:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经看过了一些电视节目 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been watching a little TV, have you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.06,1:19:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的妈妈关进监狱羁押起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hauling Mom off to jail in shackles…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.03,1:19:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是个非常漂亮的手法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was an especially nice touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.07,1:19:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在英国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.98,1:19:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,接通英国情报局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get M.I.5.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.65,1:19:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 我向你保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, I want to assure you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.05,1:19:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自首之后 我第一个工作就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my first order of business after you come in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.79,1:19:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤诉针对你家人的荒谬的指控{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to have these ridiculous charges against your family dropped…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.17,1:19:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且完全销毁他们的所有案卷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and eliminated completely from their files.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.17,1:19:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你… 如果你现在就自首{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you, uh, if you come in now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.71,1:19:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一样可以减轻对你的指控{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can plea down the charges against you as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.95,1:19:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以问你一些事情吗 奇佐治？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you something, Kittridge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.34,1:19:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然行 伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.47,1:19:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你正在对付的人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're dealing with someone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.08,1:19:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用电梯压死 用刀刺死 开枪射死 用炸弹炸死了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's crushed, stabbed, shot, and detonated…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.29,1:19:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己小组的五名队员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}five members of his own IMF team…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.38,1:20:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得把他的妈妈和唐纳德叔叔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how devastated do you think you're going to make him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.62,1:20:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,送进法院能使他崩溃到什么程度？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by marching Ma and Uncle Donald down to the county courthouse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.01,1:20:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 伊森 你何不告诉我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Ethan. Why don't you tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.21,1:20:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去连接{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.16,1:20:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要再有三秒钟就可以了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We needed three more seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.02,1:20:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想让我们知道他在伦敦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted us to know he was in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.07,1:20:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个不容易赶上的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hard man to catch up with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.11,1:20:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二天我设法让我自己回到了一个安全之处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next day I managed to drag myself back to the safe house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.70,1:20:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定是刚巧和你们错过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must have just missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.09,1:20:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之我查了一下大家的化名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I checked our aliases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.23,1:20:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你的化名是你在美国和我们结识时用的那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's when you picked us up in the States.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.24,1:20:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在我到达之前你又离开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you left before I could get there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.66,1:20:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我能查的只有这些地方而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I could check just so many places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.72,1:20:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,小国的海关记录没有计算机化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smaller countries don't computerize customs records.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.33,1:20:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我留意到欧洲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I watched Europe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.55,1:21:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前在英国待过 要找起来很容易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you turned up in England, it was easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.29,1:21:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我喜欢在利物浦大街租房子住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew I liked the rentals at Liverpool Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.39,1:21:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地方是我告诉你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I showed them to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.38,1:21:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记着呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.08,1:21:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧 你以为自己在这里正在和谁说笑？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, who do you think you're kidding here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.77,1:21:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该考虑去看医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A doctor's got to look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.11,1:21:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都无法坐直了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't sit up straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.22,1:21:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能坐直的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can sit up straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.04,1:21:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不能坐的非常直而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't sit up straight very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.81,1:21:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下来 坐下来 这个并不重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down. Sit down. It's not important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.06,1:21:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.74,1:21:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了是谁开枪射我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw who shot me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.65,1:21:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了叛徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the mole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.52,1:21:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是奇佐治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Kittridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.85,1:21:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇佐治…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kittridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.74,1:21:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是奇佐治 伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kittridge, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.07,1:21:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇佐治就是叛徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kittridge is the mole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.80,1:21:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 当然 你说的没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, of course. You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.95,1:22:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他那晚也在大使馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was at the embassy that night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.72,1:22:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 他在电梯那里除掉了杰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, he took out Jack at the elevator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.77,1:22:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.88,1:22:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在桥上开枪射了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He shot you on the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.65,1:22:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.17,1:23:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定是又回到栅栏那里 除掉了葛里森和莎拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have had backup to take out Golitsyn and Sarah at the fence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.73,1:23:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是怎么对付汉娜的呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he do Hannah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.04,1:23:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 他应该是自己动手杀了汉娜的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. He could have done Hannah himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.51,1:24:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 吉姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, Jim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.83,1:24:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.99,1:24:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你这么想 伊森 但那是不可避免的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you think about it, Ethan, it was inevitable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.96,1:24:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了冷战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more cold war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.45,1:24:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了除了自己其他人都不知道的秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more secrets you keep from everyone but yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.33,1:24:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有谁都不管的任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operationsyou answer to no one but yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.08,1:24:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着有一天你醒悟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then one day you wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.52,1:24:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国总统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The President of the United States…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.47,1:24:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是按你的意愿在治国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is running the country without your permission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.33,1:24:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗娘养的 他竟敢这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The son of a bitch. How dare he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.70,1:24:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你认识到一切结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you realize it's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.44,1:24:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是不值得升级的硬件上的一块废料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an obsolete piece of hardware not worth upgrading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.32,1:25:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的婚姻很糟糕 而且每年只有六万两千美元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a lousy marriage and 62 grand a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.56,1:25:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇佐治…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kittridge…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.20,1:25:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们追查那个一无是处的人渣太长时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll go after the no-good son of a bitch big time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.69,1:25:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以后不必再这样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.30,1:25:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将会追查我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll come after us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.92,1:25:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他会那么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going to make him do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.14,1:25:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在布拉格没拿到的是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he didn't get in Prague.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.53,1:25:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,NOC 名单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The NOC list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.14,1:25:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.62,1:25:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.97,1:25:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真伟大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.25,1:25:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.99,1:25:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天在开往巴黎的高速火车上会面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A meeting tomorrow on the TGV, en route to Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.25,1:25:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格的安检{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tight security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.35,1:25:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不允许带枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.13,1:25:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A real plus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.99,1:25:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我按照预料的 把 NOC 名单交给了马克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I supposedly deliver the NOC list to Max…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.15,1:25:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克斯已经同意了把约伯交给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max has agreed to deliver Job to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.99,1:25:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带着克莱尔和路德·斯帝盖尔 跟我一起上火车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have Claire and Luther Stickell with me on the train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.97,1:25:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里格会驾驶直升飞机在巴黎待命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krieger is going to have helicopter transport waiting in Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.18,1:25:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.86,1:26:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 刚才我在咖啡屋等你的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in a cafe waiting for you, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.39,1:26:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她伫立在雨中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there she was standing in the rain…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.61,1:26:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,活生生而且那样美丽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}alive and beautiful…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.65,1:26:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为我已经死去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}thinking I'm dead and gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.10,1:26:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道她接下来还得做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows what she's had to do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.88,1:26:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是忘掉我 然后继续向前完成任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to forget me, to keep going to get the job done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.33,1:26:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让她知道我还活着 伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't know about me, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.20,1:26:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人都不能知道 直到这件事完结为止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can. Not till this is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.08,1:26:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're probably right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.92,1:26:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,风险太大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's too much at stake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.95,1:26:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 我们离开咖啡屋之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we leave the safe house, Jim…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.13,1:26:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就在那里住下来休息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get in there and crash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.46,1:26:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在巴黎联络你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you from Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.38,1:26:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放心吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.18,1:26:55.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（明天中午TGV上见面 坐在27号座位 带上我们共同的朋友约伯）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.96,1:27:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.53,1:27:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给马克斯发了消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent the message to Max.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.92,1:27:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们定在了明天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on for tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.08,1:27:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}O.K.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.06,1:27:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这儿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.24,1:28:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.04,1:28:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.00,1:28:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到的 长官 是寄给你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming, sir, for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.04,1:28:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,X 射线检查没有问题 有电子设备 没有爆炸物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}X-ray's clean. Electronics, and no explosives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.36,1:28:45.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（高速列车 伦敦车站 中午）
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.31,1:28:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gene?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.87,1:28:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,到伦敦车站要多长时间？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long to the London terminus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.49,1:28:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十到二十五分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}20, 25 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.83,1:29:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你十分钟 行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got 10 minutes. Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.20,1:29:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.00,1:29:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让马克斯接电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me Max.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.10,1:29:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.96,1:29:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们商量的可不是这个样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was not what we discussed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.00,1:29:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我道歉 马克斯 这实在没有办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My apologies, Max. It couldn't be helped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.01,1:29:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你的座位下面有一件黑色衣服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a piece of black cloth under your seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.02,1:29:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,剥下来 你就会找到磁盘的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tear it away, and you'll find the disk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.45,1:30:29.46,Note,0,0,0,0,,（情报员名单 身份完全吻合）
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.72,1:30:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear boy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.85,1:30:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望这不会妨碍我们的私下见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope this doesn't preclude a meeting in private.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.32,1:30:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你告诉了我钱放在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not as long as you tell me where the money is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.21,1:30:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这丁点见面的可能还是值得我花一千万的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mere possibility is worth 10 million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.09,1:30:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱放在行李车厢的第三个支架上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baggage car, rack three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.24,1:30:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,银色公文包 开锁码是 314{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver briefcase, combination 314.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.64,1:30:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那约伯呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.42,1:30:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't worry about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.61,1:30:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿到钱之后 他自会去找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you get the money, he'll find you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.69,1:31:10.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（调制解调器连接失败）
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.74,1:31:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.39,1:31:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法传送{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not transmitting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.12,1:31:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试 再试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try ittry it again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.07,1:31:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 我必须在进入隧道之前传送完{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, I've got to get this through before we hit the channel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.21,1:31:27.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（锁定信号源 传送干扰信号）
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.15,1:31:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.60,1:31:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,连接被拒绝了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connection denied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.24,1:31:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己看得见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.24,1:31:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查过电池了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you check the batteries?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.66,1:31:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定检查过电池了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always check the batteries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.65,1:31:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就不要让我看到这些 从头开始检查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you give me that. Run it through from the top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.05,1:31:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是乱来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.97,1:31:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们连马克斯长什么样子都不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know what Max looks like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.34,1:31:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.10,1:31:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他拿到了名单 他会急于先核对它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's got that list, he's going to want to check it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.24,1:31:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就意味着要有笔记本电脑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that means laptops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.45,1:32:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.02,1:32:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的电话吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your telephone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.02,1:32:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.07,1:32:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么听不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hear anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.80,1:32:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么问题吧 先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything all right, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.31,1:32:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是有块电池不见了而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the battery is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.74,1:32:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.06,1:32:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.00,1:32:25.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（传送中）
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.28,1:32:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在行李车里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in the baggage car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.88,1:32:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.21,1:32:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇佐治在火车上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kittridge is on the train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.66,1:32:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在你后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.83,1:32:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱放在行李车厢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The money's in the baggage car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.34,1:32:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在那里碰头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.40,1:33:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴恩斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barnes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.78,1:33:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森在我后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan's right behind me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.44,1:33:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 吉姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Jim…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.39,1:33:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他不太好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is it such a good idea to kill him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.50,1:33:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇佐治在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kittridge is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.73,1:33:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿了钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take the money…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.14,1:34:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让伊森背黑锅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan takes the blame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.63,1:34:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有其他人看到你还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one else has seen you alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.94,1:34:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人会相信他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will believe him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.14,1:34:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.65,1:34:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才说的那些让我很遗憾 克莱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very sorry to hear you say that, Claire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.09,1:34:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.23,1:34:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.34,1:34:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森·亨特 亲爱的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan Hunt, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.46,1:34:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember him, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.00,1:34:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吉姆没死？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew about Jim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.78,1:34:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.66,1:35:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是他什么时候确切知道的就是个问题了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just exactly when he knew is something of a question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.22,1:35:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,介意告诉我吗 伊森？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind telling me, Ethan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.82,1:35:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我出现在伦敦的之前还是之后？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before or after I showed up in London?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.33,1:35:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在去伦敦之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.04,1:35:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在你从芝加哥德雷克大饭店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after you took the Bible…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.28,1:35:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走圣经之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the Drake Hotel in Chicago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.49,1:35:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在上面留记号了 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They stamped it, didn't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.52,1:35:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那群该死的犹太人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those damn Gideons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.50,1:35:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.05,1:35:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你知道了吉姆的事 那为什么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you knew about Jim, why{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.98,1:35:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你还要假装这样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the masquerade?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.74,1:35:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么还要冒这个险？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why take the risk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.73,1:35:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Claire…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.42,1:35:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问到点子上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've asked the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.85,1:35:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你就是答案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are the answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.14,1:35:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我清楚了吉姆的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew about Jim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.32,1:35:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他不知道你是不是也参与了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he didn't know about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.07,1:35:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In all fairness, Ethan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.57,1:35:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来不确定克莱尔的魅力肯定能迷住你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire was never convinced her charms would work on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.56,1:35:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我试过货色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was supremely confident…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.22,1:35:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对有自信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}having tasted the goods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.42,1:35:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友妻不可欺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thou shalt not covet their neighbor's wife…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.31,1:35:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.20,1:36:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赶快拿了钱离开这里吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just get the money and get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.93,1:36:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们先拿了钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, let's get the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.13,1:36:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 钱呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan…the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.90,1:36:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,把钱交给她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give her the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.01,1:36:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你赚的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've earned it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.06,1:36:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千万都在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All 10 million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.45,1:36:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 克莱尔说错了一件事 吉姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Claire was wrong about one thing, Jim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.29,1:36:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.22,1:36:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.48,1:36:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 费尔普斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Mr. Phelps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.33,1:36:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不是唯一看到你活着的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the only one who's seen you alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.10,1:37:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.42,1:37:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都结束了 吉姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over, Jim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.01,1:37:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 吉姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't, Jim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.29,1:37:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不要 吉姆」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Don't, Jim?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.10,1:40:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.46,1:40:24.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（连接终止 传送失败）
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.35,1:40:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.36,1:40:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在隧道里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's in the tunnel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.01,1:40:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要 它会撞上我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, don't! It'll crash into us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.10,1:40:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,加速 加速！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accelerate! Accelerate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.16,1:42:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,红灯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red light!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.38,1:42:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿灯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Green light!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.34,1:43:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要找的是这个吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is what you're looking for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.30,1:43:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 马克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Max.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.72,1:43:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的律师会让你们好看的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lawyers are going to have a field day with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.01,1:43:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,诱人犯罪 越权执法…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Entrapment, jurisdictional conflict…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.13,1:43:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们可以私下处理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe we'll just leave the courts out of this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.71,1:44:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢肯定 我能找到一些你们需要的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure we can find something I have that you need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.71,1:44:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一场奇特的事故中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a freak accident…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.01,1:44:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一架直升机失控飞进了隧道中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a helicopter lost altitude, veered into a tunnel…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.46,1:44:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后和一列从伦敦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and collided with a high-speed train…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.87,1:44:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,高速驶向巴黎的火车相撞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on its way from London to Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.07,1:44:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机驾驶员死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pilot was killed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.80,1:44:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是火车上却无一人受伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no one on the train was hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.04,1:44:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,权威人士称事故原因是机械失灵…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authorities have attributed the accident to instrument failure…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.02,1:44:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你家人了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reach your folks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.82,1:44:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有什么感想？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do they feel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.91,1:44:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.33,1:44:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,司法部门赔礼道歉 还有受到 VIP 待遇…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The apology from the Justice Department, VIP treatment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.17,1:44:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 那有多么的隆重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the whole 9 yards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.09,1:44:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈有点不明白…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my mom was a little confused…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.23,1:44:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么美国药品管理局会错把她和唐纳德叔叔…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how the DEA could mistake her and Uncle Donald…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.85,1:44:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,当成两个佛罗里达的违禁药品走私犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a couple of dope smugglers in the Florida Keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.32,1:44:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.98,1:44:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬你一杯 路德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To you, Luther.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.02,1:44:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝贺你重返局里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For being off the disavowed list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.67,1:44:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在可是风靡一时哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm the flavor of the month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.49,1:44:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不和我一起回去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come back with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.97,1:44:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.90,1:45:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不知道为了什么而做那些工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't know why I'd be doing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.50,1:45:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差不多该上飞机了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to go catch my flight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.63,1:45:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新成为优秀公民的感觉怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how does it feel to be a solid citizen again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.98,1:45:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.80,1:45:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会怀念声名狼藉时的日子的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to miss being disreputable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.57,1:45:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德 如果这样能让你感觉不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Luther, if it makes you feel any better…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.29,1:45:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会一直记着那时的你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll always think of you that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.45,1:45:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 亨特先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Mr. Hunt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.14,1:45:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要看部电影吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to watch a movie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.22,1:45:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.70,1:45:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.47,1:45:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这部加勒比海的影片怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you consider the cinema of the Caribbean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.37,1:45:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是阿鲁巴岛的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aruba, perhaps?{\r}
